<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-nijhout-butterfly-eyespot-focus-rings-code-traceability> a pk1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Nijhout (1990) & Brakefield et al. (1996) butterfly wing-vein focus determination and concentric French-flag eyespot ring morphogenesis — Code-to-model traceability: 92/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Module and function docstrings map every equation and solver step directly to Nijhout (1990) Proc. R. Soc. B, French & Brakefield (1995) Dev. Biol., Brakefield et al. (1996) Nature, Brunetti et al. (2001) Curr. Biol., Beldade et al. (2002) Nature, and the 4 formal Lean 4 theorems in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_098_butterfly_eyespot_focus_rings.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk1:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk1:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-nijhout-butterfly-eyespot-focus-rings-code-traceability-1> ;
    pk1:hasScore 9.2e-01 ;
    pk1:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-nijhout-butterfly-eyespot-focus-rings-model-fidelity> a pk1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Nijhout (1990) & Brakefield et al. (1996) butterfly wing-vein focus determination and concentric French-flag eyespot ring morphogenesis — Model fidelity to source: 93/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Couples Stage-1 2D Meinhardt activator-inhibitor reaction-diffusion inside a longitudinal wing-vein-bounded cell compartment (`solve_stage1_vein_focus_rd`, L114-187) to Stage-2 2D focal morphogen decay and concentric *Spalt* / *Engrailed* / *Distal-less* threshold induction (`solve_stage2_concentric_rings_2d` and `evaluate_all_eyespot_regimes`, L192-398) across all 5 experimental regimes plus the 6-point pupal microcautery timing series. Backed by 4 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_098_butterfly_eyespot_focus_rings.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk1:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk1:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-nijhout-butterfly-eyespot-focus-rings-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-nijhout-butterfly-eyespot-focus-rings-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-nijhout-butterfly-eyespot-focus-rings-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk1:hasScore 9.3e-01 ;
    pk1:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-nijhout-butterfly-eyespot-focus-rings-morphometric-validation> a pk1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Nijhout (1990) & Brakefield et al. (1996) butterfly wing-vein focus determination and concentric French-flag eyespot ring morphogenesis — Morphometric validation: 92/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Extracts 9 reference-anchored morphometrics in `measure_morphoeval()` (L624-715), covering Stage-1 midline focus offset (`0.0000 mm`), wet-season `R_gold` (`1.0882 mm`) and `R_black / R_gold` ratio (`0.7567`), seasonal polyphenism invariant gold annulus width (`0.2648 mm`), *Goldeneye* expanded gold annulus (`0.6941 mm`), early pupal cautery ablation (`0.0000 mm`, timing series `r = 1.0000`), twin-focus bridge overlap (`0.6765 mm`), and empirical *Bicyclus anynana* Cu1 specimen `R_black / R_gold` (`0.7569`) and calibrated `R_gold` (`1.0874 mm`)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk1:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk1:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-nijhout-butterfly-eyespot-focus-rings-measurement-bicyclus-anynana-specimen-cu1-calibrated-outer-gold-ring-radius-r-gold-bicyclus-anynana-eyespot-specimen-jpg>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-nijhout-butterfly-eyespot-focus-rings-measurement-bicyclus-anynana-specimen-cu1-eyespot-black-to-gold-radius-ratio-r-black-r-gold-bicyclus-anynana-eyespot-specimen-jpg>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-nijhout-butterfly-eyespot-focus-rings-measurement-early-pupal-focal-microcautery-ablation-outer-radius-r-gold-c0-0-05-theta-gold>,
